close_reason: "All acceptance criteria met in current main. Every item type registers with typed fields via defineExtension (index.ts); a run's metric series is only ever written to history notes (series.ts, index.ts line 189); two concurrent runs on two real git branches merge to the union of both series (test/index.test.ts line 569, test/sweep.test.ts line 321); leaderboard and invalidate answer from the dependency graph (leaderboard.ts, invalidate.ts with comprehensive tests); 100 percent line/branch/function/statement coverage across 20 source files and 139 documented declarations. The blocker pm-cli#854 is resolved: defineBeforeMutationHook is shipped and used at index.ts line 276 (guardReferencedEnvironmentMutation). All 15 children are closed. 323 tests pass."
